  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El Club de Adultos Mayores LALITA de La Pasada sostuvo una reunión con el alcalde Nabih Soza, donde abordaron proyectos para mejorar sus espacios y fortalecer sus actividades.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"💪\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/1f4aa.png\"/> Su presidente, Luis Andrade, destacó las ganas y energía de sus integrantes para seguir desarrollando nuevas iniciativas.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏋️‍♀️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t98/1/16/1f3cb_200d_2640.png\"/> El club ya cuenta con parte importante del equipamiento para implementar un espacio de actividad física, mientras sus integrantes aportan con mano de obra y materiales y el municipio apoyará con las mejoras necesarias.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"❤️\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6c/1/16/2764.png\"/> ¡Seguimos trabajando por mejores espacios y mayor bienestar para nuestras personas mayores!</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-78 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13908\" data-id=\"13908\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/puz9cbzwc6jdanw/lalita_02_1024x768_slqndgkgrd.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13909\" data-id=\"13909\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/xlq14ip33dbs29g/lalita_03_1024x768_lvk4nkuuiv.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13905\" data-id=\"13905\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/yhsgaub5hrmvusd/lalita_04_1024x768_ueo90qvetr.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13906\" data-id=\"13906\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/7wmk7utnbm30ipg/lalita_05_1024x768_2bm2fhqhf6.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13912\" data-id=\"13912\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/cem6rcwhm63mot7/lalita_07_1024x768_pnxj98dmnx.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13913\" data-id=\"13913\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/xitgfho6viytd9o/lalita_08_1024x768_wtp1bebzot.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<